// @export abi 3
// @vesper/chorus: Vesper port of vesper-chorus (Part 1 #1068 & Part 2 #1407):
// choreography front end (parsing, well-formedness, endpoint projection with
// merging, binary duality, bounded async explorer), plus SimNetCore,
// Session Monitor/Auditor/Endpoint, Raft wire codecs & CheckerCore, RaftCluster,
// and ReplogCore.
//
// All front-end state lives in one handle `C`; Part 2 adds handles
// `SimNetCore`, `Auditor`, `Mon`, `CheckerCore`, `RaftCluster`, `ReplogCore`.
//
// Input words. A string is two words, `(offset, length)` into the text
// argument. A choreography is `nroles, role strings.., ntree, tree..`; a
// tree is in postorder (children first):
//   End `5`; Var `4 s`; Rec `body.. 3 s`; Local `next.. 2 role s`;
//   Comm `next_1.. next_n 1 from to n (label payload)*n`.
// A local type is in postorder too:
//   End `8`; Var `7 s`; Rec `body.. 6 s`; Action `next.. 5 s`;
//   Send/Recv `next.. 1|2 peer label payload`;
//   Select/Offer `next_1.. next_n 3|4 peer n (label payload)*n`.
// Output words use the same forms with one word, a symbol id, per string.
